2026-10-18T13:01:10.5907630Z # reporter that grades `main` is exempt from `## Red checks` only
2026-10-18T13:01:10.5908142Z # while the diff touches none of its inputs, and a delivery row the
2026-10-18T13:01:10.5908637Z # pull request ADDS (its own) is not one; a row it edits or deletes is.
2026-10-18T13:01:10.5909224Z git diff --no-renames --name-only --diff-filter=a "$PR_BASE...$PR_HEAD" > /tmp/pr-existing.txt
